# Denali plugin export encapsulation

`@app-tour/workspace-denali/plugin` is the **host contract entry** referenced by `workspace.manifest.json` (`plugin.entry`, `plugin.export`).

Phase 6 P2 splits workspace **package.json exports** into three layers:

1. **Plugin Contract** — `./`, `./plugin`, `./theme/*`, `./settings/*` (manifest-declared settings modules; platform API and web bootstrap may import without crossing host encapsulation).
2. **Host modules** — everything else manifest-bound under `./host/*` (HTTP handlers, wizard UI, finance, photos, smoke fixtures).
3. **Internal** — `src/internal.ts` barrels; never exported.

All four workspaces (`denali`, `urban`, `starter`, `guest-club`) follow the same rule; CI enforces it via `guard:workspace-export-surface`.

## Allowed `./plugin` exports (Denali)

| Symbol | Purpose |
| ------ | ------- |
| `getWorkspacePlugin` | **Canonical** manifest `plugin.export` / `web.export` — returns frozen `WorkspacePlugin` (Phase 4m; shell loaders call this) |
| `getDenaliWorkspacePlugin` | Legacy alias of `getWorkspacePlugin` — package internals + existing tests; not referenced by generated web loaders |
| `createDenaliWorkspacePlugin` | Factory for tests and fresh instances |
| `DENALI_WORKSPACE_PLUGIN_ID` | Stable plugin id (`"denali"`) |
| `DENALI_WORKSPACE_TYPE` | Workspace-type binding |
| `DENALI_THEME_TOKENS_STYLESHEET` | Theme codegen path |
| `DENALI_THEME_ADMIN_STYLESHEET` | Admin skin bundle path |

Urban mirrors the same six-symbol contract (`guard:urban-plugin-surface`). Guest-club and starter expose plugin factory + theme identity on `./plugin` / root only.

## `./settings/*` contract surface

Manifest-bound **operator settings** modules (`settingsEnrichers`, `devBootstrap.wizardTemplate`, `web.surfaces` for settings UI) export as `./settings/<module>` keys — **not** under `./host/settings/*`. This keeps `apps/api` settings dispatch (`workspace-settings-enrichers.generated.ts`, `parse-equipment-icon-key.ts`) on a stable platform contract instead of Denali host internals.

**PSR-4b-host-imports-close (2026-07-31):** `parse-equipment-icon-key.ts` is the sole
`approved-settings-contract` allowlist entry for API host branded imports — excluded from the
unapproved host-source ceiling (must stay 0). See
[`psr-4b-host-imports-close.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-host-imports-close.mdoc).

**PSR-4b-exports (2026-07-31, partial):** host-private peel **۳۹→۳۴** (−۵ proven-dead keys:
`plugin-for-wizard-engine`, `denali-plugin-build`, `clone/hydration`,
`smoke/phase-6-denali-smoke-tenant`, `marketing` parent barrel). Target ≤۳۰ remains (−۴).
See [`psr-4b-exports.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-exports.mdoc).

**PSR-4b-exports-2 (2026-07-31):** host-private **۳۴→۳۰** — draft→unification surface;
`http.module`→`./http`; composites ghost paths→registry surface; messages locale keys→
`./host/messages/*/wizard.json`. Target ≤۳۰ **met**. See
[`psr-4b-exports-2.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-exports-2.mdoc).

**PSR-4b-configure (2026-07-31, partial):** finance configure renamed to
`configure-finance-http-host.ts` (platform-neutral); denali/urban configure imports
retargeted to `/host/http`. Product-named configure ceiling **۳**. See
[`psr-4b-configure.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-configure.mdoc)
/ [`psr-4b-configure-2.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-configure-2.mdoc)
/ [`psr-4b-configure-3.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-configure-3.mdoc)
/ [`psr-4b-configure-3b.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-configure-3b.mdoc).

**PSR-4b-configure-3 (2026-07-31, partial):** generated
`workspace-product-http-host-bindings.generated.ts` + Urban `exposureHost`; hand-written
configure adapters import the façade only — `guard-api-workspace-isolation` GREEN.
Product-named ceiling still **۲** (deletion → configure-3b).

**PSR-4b-configure-3b (2026-07-31):** product-named configure **۰** — denali+urban wiring
merged into `configure-product-http-hosts.ts` (platform-neutral); Urban exposure under
`exposure/resolve-urban-surface-exposure.ts`.

**PSR-4b-http-alias (2026-07-31):** bare `@app-tour/workspace-{denali,urban}/http`
expired in code; tsconfig compat aliases removed; `host/http` paths retained. See
[`psr-4b-http-alias.mdoc`](../audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-4b-http-alias.mdoc).

| Manifest field | Example `module` | Generated import |
| -------------- | ---------------- | ---------------- |
| `settingsEnrichers[].module` | `./settings/theme-compatible-categories` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/theme-compatible-categories` |
| `devBootstrap.wizardTemplate.module` | `./settings/denaliFullWizardTemplate` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/denaliFullWizardTemplate` |
| `web.surfaces[].module` (settings) | `./settings/wizard-template-editor` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/wizard-template-editor` |

**Codegen rule:** `importSpecifier(pkg, entry)` treats `./settings/*` as contract (no `/host/` prefix). See `isWorkspaceContractExportPath()` in `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/utils.mjs`.

**API isolation guard:** `guard:api-workspace-isolation` scans **`apps/api/src/**`** — forbids `@app-tour/workspace-*/host/settings/*` everywhere; other `@app-tour/workspace-*/host/*` imports only in `*.generated.ts` or the shrinking legacy allowlist in [`guard-api-workspace-isolation.mjs`](../../scripts/guards/guard-api-workspace-isolation.mjs).

## `./host/*` export surface

Non-contract modules (HTTP handlers, wizard UI, finance adapters, draft helpers, smoke fixtures, i18n JSON) are exported only as `./host/<path>` keys in `package.json`. The sync script `scripts/sync-workspace-host-exports.mjs` keeps dist paths aligned with `src/`.

**Codegen rule:** `importSpecifier(pkg, entry)` in `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/utils.mjs` maps manifest module paths to `@app-tour/workspace-*/host/...` unless `entry` is contract (`./plugin`, `./theme/*`, `./settings/*`, or package root).

Example manifest → import:

| Manifest field | Example value | Generated import |
| -------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |
| `settingsEnrichers[].module` | `./settings/equipment-compatible-categories` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/equipment-compatible-categories` |
| `httpRoutes.handlerPackage` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/http` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/http` |
| `catalogRegistrationFlow.surfaceModule` | `./catalog-registration-flow` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/catalog-registration-flow` |
| `web.surfaces[].webModule` | `./ui/composite-surface` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/ui/composite-surface` |

## `internal.ts` convention

- Path: `packages/workspaces/<id>/src/internal.ts` (Urban: split from former fat plugin)
- **Not** listed in `package.json` `exports` — workspace-private barrel only
- In-workspace imports: `from "../internal"` or leaf module paths
- Cross-package consumers must use `./settings/*`, `./host/*` subpaths, or plugin contract — never deep `src/` paths

## CI enforcement

| Guard | Scope |
| ----- | ----- |
| `pnpm run guard:denali-plugin-surface` | `./plugin` export allowlist (7 symbols; includes `getWorkspacePlugin`) |
| `pnpm run guard:urban-plugin-surface` | `./plugin` export allowlist (5 symbols) |
| `pnpm run guard:workspace-export-surface` | All workspace `package.json` — contract + `./settings/*` + `./host/*` keys |
| `pnpm run guard:api-workspace-isolation` | `apps/api/src/**` — settings contract + host import ratchet |

Wired into `phase-6:fast-track`.

### Wave D.a — `denali.plugin.ts` contract-only

As of Wave D.a, `denali.plugin.ts` must not re-export wizard/rules/registration/template helpers. Those live under leaf modules + `internal.ts`; see [`wave-d-denali-plugin-surface.mdoc`](./wave-d-denali-plugin-surface.mdoc).

### Wave D.b — `urban.plugin.ts` contract-only

Urban mirrors Denali: `urban.plugin.ts` is a five-symbol façade over `internal.ts`; see [`wave-d-urban-plugin-surface.mdoc`](./wave-d-urban-plugin-surface.mdoc).

## Migration map (pre-P2 → post-P2)

| Former import | New import |
| ------------- | ---------- |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/wizard/wizard-rules-surface` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/wizard/wizard-rules-surface` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/adapters/canonical-basics` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/adapters/canonical-basics` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/http` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/http` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/ui/*` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/ui/*` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/messages/*/wizard.json` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/messages/*/wizard.json` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-guest-club/guest-club.plugin` | `@app-tour/workspace-guest-club/plugin` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-starter/exposure` | `@app-tour/workspace-starter/host/exposure` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-urban/http` | `@app-tour/workspace-urban/host/http` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/settings/*` (regression) | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/settings/*` |
| `@app-tour/workspace-denali` (root barrel — finance, photos, …) | `@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/<module>` or `/plugin` |

Contract paths **unchanged:** `@app-tour/workspace-*/plugin`, `@app-tour/workspace-*/theme/*`, `@app-tour/workspace-*/settings/*`.

## Regenerate after manifest or export changes

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
```

Produces 57 outputs from four manifests (HTTP routes, plugin loaders, wizard bindings, registration transport, theme CSS, etc.).
